  "howTo": [
    "Each key types the Georgian letter that sounds like it: A is ა, B is ბ. Georgian has no capitals, so Shift types a second letter on seven keys: ჭ on W, ღ on R, თ on T, შ on S, ჟ on J, ძ on Z, ჩ on C. No accents here, so holding a key still gives its symbol."
